---
import PublicLayout from "../layouts/PublicLayout.astro";
---

<PublicLayout title="Terms of Use" description="Terms of Use for Late Diagnosed.">
  <main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <h1 class="font-heading text-5xl text-[#1e2a5e] mb-6">Terms of Use</h1>

    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-8">Last updated: June 2026</p>

    <section class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        By using this website, you agree to these Terms of Use. If you do not agree, please do not use the website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">Educational Purpose</h2>
      <p>
        Late Diagnosed provides educational resources, public information, and community-oriented content related to neurodivergence, late diagnosis, trauma-related conditions, and related topics.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">No Medical, Mental Health, or Professional Services</h2>
      <p>
        Late Diagnosed does not provide medical services, mental health services, therapy, diagnosis, treatment, crisis services, legal advice, financial advice, or other professional services through this website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">No Professional Relationship</h2>
      <p>
        Use of this website does not create a doctor-patient relationship, therapist-client relationship, professional relationship, fiduciary relationship, or any other formal service relationship with Late Diagnosed or anyone associated with the organization.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">No Liability for Use of Information</h2>
      <p>
        Visitors are responsible for how they use information found on this website. Late Diagnosed is not liable for decisions, actions, outcomes, damages, or losses that may result from use of or reliance on website content.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">Donations</h2>
      <p>
        Late Diagnosed may accept donations through a third-party payment or donation processor. Donation transactions are subject to the terms, privacy policies, and processing rules of the selected provider.
      </p>

      <p>
        Unless otherwise stated, donations are voluntary contributions to support the nonprofit mission of Late Diagnosed and do not create a purchase, membership, professional service relationship, or entitlement to specific services.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">Use of Content</h2>
      <p>
        Website content may not be copied, republished, sold, or presented as your own without permission. You may share links to public pages for educational and informational purposes.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">Respectful Use</h2>
      <p>
        Visitors agree not to misuse the website, attempt unauthorized access, interfere with site operation, or use the website to harass, threaten, exploit, or harm others.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">External Links</h2>
      <p>
        This website may link to third-party resources. Late Diagnosed does not control and is not responsible for third-party websites, services, policies, or content.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">Changes</h2>
      <p>
        Late Diagnosed may update these Terms of Use from time to time. Continued use of the website means you accept the updated terms.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions may be sent to <a class="text-[#1e2a5e] underline" href="mailto:info@latediagnosed.org">info@latediagnosed.org</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</PublicLayout>
